65	    ///   consumer released the previous lap by storing
66	    ///   `pos + M`, which is this lap's `p`. Anything else reads
67	    ///   as Full, never as a slot the protocol does not own.
68	    /// - Only `producer_idx` (ours, loaded once) and the slot's
